# soc_density_report doc lai ./verify_rpt/density_all.rpt
Mat do - layer doc: M1 M2 M3 M4 M5 M6 M7 M8 M9 Pad
  M1   duoi min: 0 tren macro SRAM + 0 trong vung logic
  M2   duoi min: 0 tren macro SRAM + 1 trong vung logic (thap nhat 22.45%)
  M3   duoi min: 0 tren macro SRAM + 0 trong vung logic | 2 window VUOT tran
  M4   duoi min: 0 tren macro SRAM + 0 trong vung logic
  M5   duoi min: 1109 tren macro SRAM + 0 trong vung logic
  M6   duoi min: 0 tren macro SRAM + 0 trong vung logic
  M7   duoi min: 0 tren macro SRAM + 0 trong vung logic
  M8   duoi min: 0 tren macro SRAM + 0 trong vung logic
  M9   duoi min: 0 tren macro SRAM + 0 trong vung logic
  Pad  duoi min: 0 tren macro SRAM + 0 trong vung logic
  2 window vuot tran mat do: fill do them vao window von da qua tran (cua so chong nhau 50%).  Chi cac layer co MAXIMUMDENSITY that trong tech LEF moi dang lo - ASAP7 chi co M5 (90%) va Pad (80%).
WARNING: 1 window vung logic duoi nguong - metal fill chua du, xem lai SOC_FILL_LAYERS (nhat la -maxWidth / -decrement)
  1109 window de len macro SRAM: PENDING_MERGED_GDS_SIGNOFF (abstract khong co metal trong macro)

# Vi sao nhom tren macro khong ket luan duoc o day
#   - Density la luat CMP tren WAFER, phai signoff tren GDS da merge
#     (GDS macro + GDS top) bang Calibre/Pegasus, khong phai tren view
#     abstract cua P&R.
#   - Innovus chi thay LEF cua SRAM: OBS chan kin M1-M3/V1-V3 nhung M4
#     chi 0.6% va M5 chi 0.4% dien tich macro.  Ruot macro khong co hinh
#     nen mat do doc ra luon thap, du fill co tot den dau.
#   - ASAP7 KHONG ship GDS cho SRAM, nen lan signoff do hien chua chay
#     duoc.  Trang thai trung thuc la PENDING, khong phai PASS/FAIL.
#   - KHONG nhoi fill len macro de lam xanh con so: do la PASS gia, no
#     xoa mat co bao con viec chua kiem, va dat 25% kim loai len mang
#     nho la rui ro coupling doi lay mot con so khong kiem chung duoc.
#     OBS trong tren M4/M5 la giay phep ROUTE qua, khong phai giay phep FILL.
#   - Ty le window hong bam sat ty le dien tich macro tren die:
#     mcu 53.9% macro -> 56.9% window; sram_axi 70.5% macro -> 70.5% window.
#     Do la dac tinh cua floorplan nhieu macro, khong phai loi cua fill.
# Dieu kien DONG: co GDS that cua SRAM -> merge -> chay density tren do.
# Chi so co nghia o buoc nay la vung logic (phan minh dat duoc fill):
#   1 window duoi nguong -> phai bang 0 thi flow moi di tiep.
